vices of the power plant; and invests in electricity sector. The Industry segment produces concrete precast of piles, girders, rail pads, steel construction, automotive spare parts, energy conversion product, and mining industry. Its Realty and Property segment offers landed housing and high rise, such as an apartment building and building and condotel management. The Hotel segment in involved in goods and services provided to hotel guests and hotel restaurant visitors. The Investment segment engages in the activities on toll roads operation from concession assets. The company was founded in 1960 and is headquartered in Jakarta, Indonesia.","fullTimeEmployees":3408,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Engineer Agung Budi Waskito","age":54,"title":"President Director","yearBorn":1971,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":{"raw":3698000000,"fmt":"3.7B","longFmt":"3,698,000,000"},"exercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"},"unexercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"}},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. .  Sumadi","age":53,"title":"Director of Finance & Director","yearBorn":1972,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":{"raw":3159800000,"fmt":"3.16B","longFmt":"3,159,800,000"},"exercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"},"unexercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"}},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Hananto  Aji","age":51,"title":"Director of Operations & Director","yearBorn":1974,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":{"raw":3159800000,"fmt":"3.16B","longFmt":"3,159,800,000"},"exercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"},"unexercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"}},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Fafan Khoirul Fanani M.Sc.","age":52,"title":"Director of Risk Management & Legal and Director","yearBorn":1973,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":{"raw":1173000000,"fmt":"1.17B","longFmt":"1,173,000,000"},"exercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"},"unexercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"}},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Engineer Hadjar Seti Adji MEng Sc IPU","age":60,"title":"Dire